	(text "Mikrokit V2.0 8085 trainer (Micro Design Ltd, Athens, 1985).\nRedrawn in KiCad from the three scanned schematic sheets dated 7-3-1985.\nReference designators, jumper numbers and connector pin numbers follow the original.\nSee NOTES.md for what was inferred and what to check on a real board."
